<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-096" chapter-id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short" source-id="s-jinshu-096-wang080-short">
  <p id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:family" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:family:m0000" ref="f7d_ipd_k1o">王凝之</persName>妻<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:family:m0004" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CE">謝氏</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:family:m0008" ref="aa6_83c_juy_CE">道韞</persName>，安西將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:family:m0015" ref="aa6_83c_juy_C">奕</persName>之女也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:loss" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">及遭<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:loss:m0002" ref="a7f_c0a_373">孫恩</persName>之難，舉厝自若，既聞夫及諸子已為賊所害</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:ningfather" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初適<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:ningfather:m0002" ref="f7d_ipd_k1o">凝之</persName>，還，甚不樂。<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:ningfather:m0011" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">安</persName>曰：「<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:ningfather:m0015" ref="f7d_ipd_k1o">王郎</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-096-wang080-short:ningfather:m0018" ref="326_faf_cd3">逸少</persName>子，不惡，汝何恨也？」</p>
</text>
